33-wangji:line035","text":"臣備位宰輔，與國存亡，誠乏平勃濟時之略，然自忘駑駘，志存社稷，豈忍坐視成敗，以虧聖美。事不獲已，今輒進軍，同討奸孽，願陛下深垂省察，速斬隗首，則眾望厭服，皇祚復隆。隗首朝懸，諸軍夕退。昔太甲不能遵明湯典，顛覆厥度，幸納伊尹之勳，殷道復昌。漢武雄略，亦惑江充讒佞邪說，至乃父子相屠，流血丹地，終能克悟，不失大綱。今日之事，有逾於此，願陛下深垂三思，諮詢善道，則四海乂安，社稷永固矣。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"隗","kind":"person","person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"2qj_hw4_si9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m_e0h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"itn_zi2_il4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"漢武","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line035:m0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"江充","kind":"person","person_id":"eqh_hzf_78x","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":35,"last_line":35,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"臣備位宰輔，與國存亡，誠乏平勃濟時之略，然自忘駑駘，志存社稷，豈忍坐視成敗，以虧聖美。事不獲已，今輒進軍，同討奸孽，願陛下深垂省察，速斬隗首，則眾望厭服，皇祚復隆。隗首朝懸，諸軍夕退。昔太甲不能遵明湯典，顛覆厥度，幸納伊尹之勳，殷道復昌。漢武雄略，亦惑江充讒佞邪說，至乃父子相屠，流血丹地，終能克悟，不失大綱。今日之事，有逾於此，願陛下深垂三思，諮詢善道，則四海乂安，社稷永固矣。","raw_start":3096,"raw_end":3286,"raw_line":35},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-zhuju:line096-pei01-01","text":"殷基《通语》载据争曰：“臣闻太子国之本根，雅性仁孝，天下归心，今卒责之，将有一朝之虑。昔晋献用骊姬而申生不存，汉武信江充而戾太子冤死。臣窃惧太子不堪其忧，虽立思子之宫，无所复及矣。”","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-zhuju:line096-pei01-01:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"殷基","kind":"person","person_id":"i5r_vby_q00_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-zhuju:line096-pei01-01:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"据","kind":"person","person_id":"ejj_vdz_hxw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-zhuju:line096-pei01-01:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-zhuju:line096-pei01-01:m0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"晋献","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-zhuju:line096-pei01-01:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"骊姬","kind":"person","person_id":"oza_c7e_kas","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-zhuju:line096-pei01-01:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"申生","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi